  "prefLabel": "Puc 1104.02 Customer's Bill Adjustments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1104.02 Customer's Bill Adjustments.\n\n(a) The utility shall make refunds or charges, as applicable, when testing done in accordance with Puc 1104.01(b) or (c) indicates an error greater than 3%.\n\n(b) Such refunds or charges shall be made in accordance with the terms specified in the utility's tariff.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter heading Puc 1100) #6445, eff 1-28-97; ss by #8244, eff 12-31-04; ss by #10307, eff 4-9-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1100.html"
}
